{"n":5,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0013.00.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"---\naddress: 10.11.21.0013\ntitle: common-questions\ntype: general\nstate: draft\nwhy-draft: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n---\n\n## Registry\nfaces: 01 draft, 04 draft\nwhy-01: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it. The `question` card type is not in the kernel card-type table (decisions.md C8.9); `7`.\nwhy-04: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n\nR10 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:40), R12 (:53) and R19 (:75): face 00 holds the stamp, the page type and the registry. Layout follows docs/spec/face00.md (DRAFT, not ruled): `why-draft` and `why-NN` are PROPOSED names there; `seat-NN` is the build's own (`7`, QUESTIONS Q34); per-type registry fields are not written (`7`, Q33); `faces:` is written here and checked by the builder against the files (written vs derived is `7`, face00.md F2, CONFLICTS D5).\n\nR11 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:44): the common questions list. Page number `0013` is `7`: chosen in 0010-0019 (static, R17) to match crates/ask (COMPUTE); the Director has not placed it.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0013"}
{"n":6,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0013.01.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it. The `question` card type is not in the kernel card-type table (decisions.md C8.9); `7`.","body":"## what is my name\ntype: question\nforms: what is my name\nanswer: 10.11.21.1001.01.bob\n\nR11 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:44): \"The what is my name will become part of a common questions people ask list. When we see a version of this, it becomes linked as a sentence; it works like brands do.\" `7`: the card fields (`type: question`, `forms`, `answer`) match crates/ask `QuestionCard`; the Director has not given them.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0013"}
{"n":7,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0013.04.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"## what is my name\nsource: [01 / what is my name] Bob test, session 2 question; why: docs/spec/DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:44\nwhy: This is how we let the compute solve.\n\nWhen the user asks \"what is my name\", the key words what + my + name match this question, and it points to the bob card, the user's name.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0013"}
{"n":8,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1001.00.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"---\naddress: 10.11.21.1001\ntitle: bob\ntype: general\nstate: draft\nwhy-draft: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n---\n\n## Registry\nfaces: 01 seated\nseat-01: approved-by: build-stage (R2); trial: docs/trial/kernel-trial-2.md@ed82086; blob: 5415cef2\n\nR10 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:40), R12 (:53) and R19 (:75): face 00 holds the stamp, the page type and the registry. Layout follows docs/spec/face00.md (DRAFT, not ruled): `why-draft` and `why-NN` are PROPOSED names there; `seat-NN` is the build's own (`7`, QUESTIONS Q34); per-type registry fields are not written (`7`, Q33); `faces:` is written here and checked by the builder against the files (written vs derived is `7`, face00.md F2, CONFLICTS D5).\n\nR15 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:62): a brand card on face 01 needs no 04 card, so the `04` face that held the bob and cats whys was removed in kernel pass 3.\n\nR2 seat (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:7-9, R20 :78-80): face 01 passed TRIAL-K2 and is seated at the cited blob; this face 00 stays a draft (R14). Where a seat record lives is `7` (QUESTIONS Q34): it is kept here, in `seat-01:`, so the seated face itself is unchanged.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.1001"}
{"n":9,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1001.01","approved-by":"build-stage (R2)","trial":"docs/trial/kernel-trial-2.md@ed82086 blob 5415cef2","body":"## bob\ntype: brand\nbrand: bob.001\nforms: Bob\nmeans: the user's name\n\n## cats\ntype: brand\nbrand: cats.001\nforms: cats\nmeans: animals the user likes","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.1001"}
